            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is a Konsole bug. It doesn't report <kbd>Esc</kbd> press as a CSI u sequence when enabling kitty \"Disambiguate escape code\", while it does report <kbd>Esc</kbd> release properly when enabling kitty \"Report event types\". So this arrives as `\\x1b` followed immediately by a release event, which libtermkey recognizes as a release event with <kbd>Alt</kbd> modifier, which is no-op.",
            "created_at": "2026-09-08T01:01:35Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/41763#issuecomment-5577476834",
            "id": 5577476834,
            "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/41763",
            "minimized": null,
            "node_id": "IC_kwDOAPphoM8AAAABTHGK4g",
            "performed_via_github_app": null,
            "pin": null,
